message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: APE-HE Beamline mapper
abstract: APE-HE Mapper is a tool designed for mapping APE-HE (Advanced Photoelectric Effect - High Energy) metadata to a uniform, schema-compliant json format. This project includes the extraction of metadata from NeXus (.nxs) files and can be extended for other existing formats.
version: 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT
